\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  We start this journey in the Lord,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 We beseech Thee, lead us on our way.
\par The love of our Heav'nly Father,
\par Shall take care of all soul and flesh.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Good Saviour, guard us on our way,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 As Thou also travelled some day,
\par Thou hast promised Thy followers,
\par That you will be with them always.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Let the pow'r of the Holy Ghost,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Rule over us and stay with us.
\par Comfort us in our times of need,
\par \pard     Take us along and bring us back.          \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

